   - BN projector and LL init (mlp projector, looks_linear), each with static 0.2 and with linear 1.0→0.05 over 10 epochs;
   - transfer (transfer_pretrain_epochs 200, epochs 100) with static 0.2 and with linear 1.0→0.05 over 5 epochs;
